        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Twin Tile</strong></i> brings you a memory challenge. You can play by yourself or against your family and friends while you enjoy these pixel-art tiles. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Several gamemodes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Classic</strong>:</u> up to 4 players compete to get the most amount of pairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/041c3c03cbdd4293d63f027160303f71.poster.avif?t=1788278698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/041c3c03cbdd4293d63f027160303f71.webm?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/041c3c03cbdd4293d63f027160303f71.mp4?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Time Trial</strong>:</u> challenge yourself on the 24-tile panel and try to make it as fast as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/72dc8750924cf97f1646d4ada9538730.poster.avif?t=1788278698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/72dc8750924cf97f1646d4ada9538730.webm?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/72dc8750924cf97f1646d4ada9538730.mp4?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Expert:</strong></u> looking for a real challenge? Expert mode will set you through a series of increasing-difficulty levels. But watch out! If you make a mistake, you'll have to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/692d52302953c20c617a5b2fe8e6db75.poster.avif?t=1788278698\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/692d52302953c20c617a5b2fe8e6db75.webm?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3937800/extras/692d52302953c20c617a5b2fe8e6db75.mp4?t=1788278698\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own &quot;azulejos&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >¿Would you like to create your own tiles? Visit the <strong>Workshop</strong> and paint one by hand or using several tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock all of them tiles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>60 different tiles</strong> await you! </p>",
